<h1 class="govuk-heading-xl">Defra Frontend</h1>

<p class="govuk-body-l">
  A theme layer over GOV.UK Frontend for Defra services. It does not fork
  GOV.UK Frontend and it does not replace it.
</p>

<div class="govuk-inset-text">
  This is an unapproved prototype. The colour and typeface values are placeholders
  rather than the result of a brand audit, and the library is not yet approved for
  use in a live service.
</div>

